  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/metallic-reactance.webp
  Description: The metals in your armor are carefully alloyed to ground electricity
    and protect from acidic chemical reactions. You gain resistance equal to 3 +
    half your level to acid and electricity damage. When under the effects of Overdrive,
    the resistance increases by 2.
